      "id": "5847e58d-1e78-4229-b22b-82b16473e053",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "int a = 43;\r\n\r\n//Syntax\r\n// if(condition){\r\n\r\n// }else{\r\n\r\n// }\r\n\r\n\r\nif(a > 32){\r\n    int number = 12;\r\n    int number1 = 32;\r\n\r\n    int sum = number + number1;\r\n    System.out.println(\"a is greater than b : \"+sum);\r\n}else{\r\n    int number = 12;\r\n    int number1 = 32;\r\n\r\n    int sum = number1 - number;\r\n    System.out.println(\"a is less than b : \"+sum);\r\n}",
      "metadata": {
